{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Where a person in Georgia can get free legal help: the state Legal Aid Service, the Public Defender and others, with phone, hours and website. Give these when the matter is serious, a deadline is running or the person cannot pay a lawyer. \u10e1\u10d0\u10d3 \u10db\u10d8\u10d8\u10e6\u10d4\u10d1\u10e1 \u10d0\u10d3\u10d0\u10db\u10d8\u10d0\u10dc\u10d8 \u10e3\u10e4\u10d0\u10e1\u10dd \u10d8\u10e3\u10e0\u10d8\u10d3\u10d8\u10e3\u10da \u10d3\u10d0\u10ee\u10db\u10d0\u10e0\u10d4\u10d1\u10d0\u10e1 \u10e1\u10d0\u10e5\u10d0\u10e0\u10d7\u10d5\u10d4\u10da\u10dd\u10e8\u10d8: \u10e2\u10d4\u10da\u10d4\u10e4\u10dd\u10dc\u10d8, \u10e1\u10d0\u10db\u10e3\u10e8\u10d0\u10dd \u10e1\u10d0\u10d0\u10d7\u10d4\u10d1\u10d8 \u10d3\u10d0 \u10d5\u10d4\u10d1\u10d2\u10d5\u10d4\u10e0\u10d3\u10d8.","inputSchema":{"properties":{},"title":"find_legal_aidArguments","type":"object"},"name":"find_legal_aid","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"LegalAidProvider":{"properties":{"checked_on":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Day a person last checked this contact against its source.","title":"Checked On"},"email":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Email"},"free_for":{"title":"Free For","type":"string"},"helps_with":{"title":"Helps With","type":"string"},"hours":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Hours"},"legal_basis":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Legal Basis"},"name":{"title":"Name","type":"string"},"phone":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Phone"},"source":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Where it was checked.","title":"Source"},"website":{"title":"Website","type":"string"}},"required":["name","helps_with","free_for","website"],"title":"LegalAidProvider","type":"object"}},"properties